  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2306.02 Fee",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2306.02 Fee. Pursuant to RSA 270-E:5, III, each applicant shall pay the vessel manufacturer or dealer registration fee and the boat decal fee, along with the application set forth in Saf-C 2306.01.\n\nSource. #5283, eff 11-22-91; amd by #5477, eff 9-23-92; ss by #6616, eff 10-25-97, EXPIRED: 10-25-05\n\nNew. #8506, INTERIM, eff 12-7-05, EXPIRES: 6-5-06; ss and moved by #8617, eff 4-28-06, (from Saf-C 2303.02) EXPIRED: 1-21-15 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 2300)\n\nNew. #10787, eff 2-20-15; ss by #14321, eff 7-16-25, EXPIRES: 7-16-35",
